Add an autogenerated header file that describes hardware registers along with
set of macros that set/get values. The macros do static checks to avoid
overflow, handle endianess, and overall provide a clean way to code commands.
In this patch we make use of these macros in set/query HCA capabilities
command; in the future the code will be transformed to use this method for all
the command.

In addition, some logical changes were made in handling HCA capabilities.

Signed-off-by: Eli Cohen <eli@mellanox.com>
